### Review findings

One real concern to flag for Codex: `HypothesisBoard` imports from `@/lib/game/hypothesis` and `@/lib/game/types` separately. If Codex adds `hypothesis.ts` to the barrel `src/lib/game/index.ts`, the import path can be simplified to `@/lib/game` — but that's Codex's call since `index.ts` is outside my scope.

